OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FLionel Messi turned his official
OL,7,Ffarewell to Argentina into a gala
OL,8,Fperformance on Tuesday, contributing a
OL,9,Fpenalty and two assists in a 3-0 win
OL,10,Fover Benin at the Monumental Stadium
OL,11,Fin Buenos Aires.
OL,13,FThe crowd of 85,000 fans offered a
OL,14,Fdeafening final ovation to the
OL,15,Ffootball star, who has defined the
OL,16,Fpulse of a nation for two decades.
OL,18,FThe match saw him cap off his
OL,19,Finternational career spanning 21
OL,20,Fyears, 126 goals, a 2022 World Cup
OL,21,Fvictory, and two Copa America titles.
OL,26,@}D@Yrr
