OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791381056
OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,F"It was a source of great pride to
OL,7,Fwear this jersey for over 20 years,"
OL,8,FMessi told the crowd, speaking into a
OL,9,Fmicrophone from the center of the
OL,10,Fpitch.
OL,12,F"I never stopped fighting, never
OL,13,Fstopped giving my all. I would love to
OL,14,Fkeep coming back forever, because
OL,15,Fplaying for the Argentine national
OL,16,Fteam is the most beautiful thing that
OL,17,Fcan happen to you."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@dO]tD@AOU
