OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791381056
OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FHis teammates, many of whom were
OL,7,Fovercome with emotion, along with the
OL,8,Fcoaching staff led by Lionel Scaloni
OL,9,Fand the fans, gave him a standing
OL,10,Fovation.
OL,12,F"I'm going to miss you all. Now I'll
OL,13,Fbe on your side, supporting the
OL,14,Fnational team and the guys who come
OL,15,Fnext," Messi promised.
OL,17,F"When we're united, we're stronger
OL,18,Fthan anyone and can overcome anything.
OL,19,FTough times lie ahead, because what
OL,20,Fthis group achieved won't be easy to
OL,21,Frepeat."
OL,26,@tD@AOUwD@FO]yD@AOU
