OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FFollowing a corner kick taken by
OL,7,FMessi, defender Nicolas Otamendi
OL,8,Fconnected with a header to open the
OL,9,Fscoring in the 48th minute.
OL,11,FMessi then provided an assist to young
OL,12,Ftalent Nicolas Paz, who paid tribute
OL,13,Fto the star with an exquisite left-
OL,14,Ffoot finish in the 61st.
OL,16,FTen minutes later, Messi buried a left-
OL,17,Ffoot penalty into the top corner,
OL,18,Fadding to his tally as the
OL,19,FAlbiceleste's all-time leading scorer.
OL,20,F"Ole, ole, Messi," the crowd chanted
OL,21,Fin his honor.
