OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FDespite still playing at a high level
OL,7,Fat age 39, Messi announced on August
OL,8,F31 that the end of his time with
OL,9,FArgentina was set.
OL,11,FMessi played his final match - his
OL,12,F208th for Argentina - amid a
OL,13,Fspectacular fireworks display, and
OL,14,Fwore a special edition Albiceleste
OL,15,Fjersey featuring wider vertical
OL,16,Fstripes than the standard design, a
OL,17,Fgiant sun, and a golden No. 10 on the
OL,18,Fback.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
