OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791381056
OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FThe back detail featured a goat's
OL,7,Fhorns in the print - a nod to the
OL,8,F"GOAT," referencing both the animal
OL,9,Fand his status as the "Greatest of All
OL,10,FTime."
OL,12,FTen minutes after kickoff in the
OL,13,Finternational friendly, the referee
OL,14,Fpaused the match to honor the
OL,15,FArgentine captain.
