OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791381056
OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FAfter the match ended, he thanked his
OL,7,Fteammates for the titles they had won
OL,8,Fand left them with a directive: "We
OL,9,Fneed to build a strong, united group
OL,10,Fbecause there are people who want the
OL,11,Fnational team to fail, and we
OL,12,Fshouldn't give them the satisfaction."
OL,14,FA successor to the legendary Diego
OL,15,FMaradona, Messi made his senior
OL,16,Fnational team debut in 2005.
