OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791381056
OL,3,CMessi bids Argentina an emotional
OL,4,Cfarewell after 3-0 win against Benin
OL,6,FHis journey was fraught with
OL,7,Ffrustration until 2022, when he
OL,8,Ffinally lifted the World Cup - a
OL,9,Ftriumph that secured his place in the
OL,10,Fpantheon of the sport's greatest
OL,11,Fplayers and cemented his status as a
OL,12,Fnational hero in Argentina.
OL,14,FAccompanied by his sons Thiago, Mateo,
OL,15,Fand Ciro, Messi was overcome with
OL,16,Femotion as the Argentine national
OL,17,Fanthem played, sung by a veteran of
OL,18,Fthe 1982 Falklands War.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
